  "id": "924da90772e9",
  "title": "Motion Sensors and Home Security Gadgets Without Cameras",
  "originalTitle": "Motion Sensors and Home Security Gadgets Without Cameras",
  "source": "Hacker News",
  "category": "Tech",
  "url": "https://www.wired.com/story/best-motion-sensors-private-alternatives-security/",
  "publishedAt": "2026-07-19T07:02:09.000Z",
  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div data-testid=\"ArticlePageChunks\"><div data-journey-hook=\"grid-wrapper\" data-testid=\"BodyWrapper\"><p><span>Security cameras are</span> cheap and abundant, but many folks are uncomfortable with the idea of a video feed showing the inside of their home. Even as a security camera reviewer, I get it. The risks add up quickly, whether it's <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/security-camera-tips-and-risks/\">vulnerabilities exposing your video feed</a> to the internet, powerful microphones picking up your private conversations, or overzealous companies <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/how-to-secure-your-video-doorbell/\">sharing video with the surveillance state</a>.</p><p>The good news is you don’t need a camera to secure your home or detect intruders. I tested several motion sensors and alternative systems that can alert you of activity just as effectively without sacrificing your privacy.</p><p>(If you do happen to be OK with a more conventional approach to home security, check out my recommendations for the <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/gallery/best-security-cameras/\">Best Indoor Security Cameras</a>, <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/gallery/best-outdoor-security-cameras/\">Best Outdoor Security Cameras</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/gallery/best-video-doorbells/\">Best Video Doorbell Cameras</a>.)</p><h2>An Old-School Radar System</h2><div id=\"6a55f8d0a68cc3d51ed0a115\" data-item=\"{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;Letwesaf&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;Radar Motion Alarm System&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:&quot;feature-medium&quot;,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:true,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/LETWESAF-Perimeter-Detection-Rechargeable-Weatherproof/dp/B0F9T4G8MP/&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;6a55f8d0a68cc3d51ed0a115&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:&quot;Photograph: Simon Hill&quot;,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:true,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;isUpcEnabled&quot;:true,&quot;showClampedProductDescription&quot;:true,&quot;productDescriptionLineLength&quot;:5,&quot;hasReadMoreFeature&quot;:false,&quot;index&quot;:0,&quot;hasAffiliateLinkDisabled&quot;:false,&quot;isMobileView&quot;:false,&quot;showMultipleImageCount&quot;:4,&quot;hasProsConsFeature&quot;:false,&quot;hasRatingFeature&quot;:false,&quot;pros&quot;:[],&quot;cons&quot;:[],&quot;rating&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shouldUseAmazonPrimeDayLiveAPIData&quot;:true,&quot;contentInfo&quot;:{&quot;contentUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.wired.com/story/best-motion-sensors-private-alternatives-security/&quot;,&quot;contentName&quot;:&quot;The Best Motion Sensors and Privacy Alternatives to Security Cameras&quot;},&quot;enableGtmFixesIntersectionObserver&quot;:true,&quot;enableGtmFixesUseRef&quot;:true,&quot;textBadge&quot;:null,&quot;seal&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6a55f8d0a68cc3d51ed0a115&quot;,&quot;brand&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Letwesaf&quot;},&quot;offers&quot;:[{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/LETWESAF-Perimeter-Detection-Rechargeable-Weatherproof/dp/B0F9T4G8MP/&quot;,&quot;price&quot;:&quot;$220&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;purchaseUri&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;sellerName&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;countryCode&quot;:&quot;US&quot;,&quot;offerId&quot;:&quot;6a55f91a7c1ffff927a68550&quot;,&quot;reducedPrice&quot;:&quot;&quot;}],&quot;component&quot;:&quot;enhanced_product_card&quot;,&quot;total_index&quot;:4,&quot;hasMultipleImage&quot;:true,&quot;showProsConsData&quot;:false,&quot;videoIds&quot;:[],&quot;offersLength&quot;:1,&quot;hasBookmarkingFeature&quot;:true,&quot;isBookmarked&quot;:false,&quot;isBookmarkStatusReady&quot;:false}\" data-testid=\"feature-large-callout\"><p>Letwesaf</p><p><h3 id=\"upc_6a55f8d0a68cc3d51ed0a115\" type=\"embed\">Radar Motion Alarm System</h3></p></div><p>This radar system is ideal for protecting larger properties, with its range of up to half a mile and adjustable detection zone. It’s old school: With no Wi-Fi or app needed, you simply turn on the receiver and pair the detector. It then sounds an alarm whenever a person or animal moves into the area. You can pair up to six detectors with the receiver (though you only get one), and they are IP65-rated, so they’ll survive just fine in any weather. Each <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.amazon.com/LETWESAF-Wireless-Motion-Detector-Sensor/dp/B0G1HST6SB\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\" data-aps-asin=\"B0G1HST6SB\" data-aps-asc-tag=\"w050b-20\">additional detector costs $120</a>, so it could be quite an expensive system. By default, the detection zone is a rectangle around 20 x 17 feet. You can extend it up to 50 feet, though I found the process outlined in the manual a bit fiddly and unclear (you have to move within the detection zone and press the right buttons).</p><p>After testing in a couple of outdoor scenarios (side passage and backyard), I was impressed by this system. It reliably picked up and alerted motion by people and my cats without being triggered by wind causing movement in the bushes. This could be handy for guarding the exterior of your home, outbuildings, or even for protecting your campsite or RV on trips. The downside is that the 3,000-mAh rechargeable battery needs topping off every five or six days. You can plug a power bank into the USB-C port, but for fixed outdoor installations, you might consider snagging a wee USB-C solar panel.</p><h2>A Simple Motion Sensor</h2><div id=\"6a55f876172a7c9e12eea5d2\" data-item=\"{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;Kinisium&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;Kini SafeAlert Wi-Fi Motion Sensor&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:&quot;feature-medium&quot;,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/Wireless-Security-Motion-SMS-Alerts/dp/B0CQPPFHWF/&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;6a55f876172a7c9e12eea5d2&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:&quot;Photograph: Simon Hill&quot;,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:true,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;isUpcEnabled&quot;:true,&quot;showClampedProductDescription&quot;:true,&quot;productDescriptionLineLength&quot;:5,&quot;hasReadMoreFeature&quot;:false,&quot;index&quot;:1,&quot;hasAffiliateLinkDisabled&quot;:false,&quot;isMobileView&quot;:false,&quot;showMultipleImageCount&quot;:4,&quot;hasProsConsFeature&quot;:false,&quot;hasRatingFeature&quot;:false,&quot;pros&quot;:[],&quot;cons&quot;:[],&quot;rating&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shouldUseAmazonPrimeDayLiveAPIData&quot;:true,&quot;contentInfo&quot;:{&quot;contentUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.wired.com/story/best-motion-sensors-private-alternatives-security/&quot;,&quot;contentName&quot;:&quot;The Best Motion Sensors and Privacy Alternatives to Security Cameras&quot;},&quot;enableGtmFixesIntersectionObserver&quot;:true,&quot;enableGtmFixesUseRef&quot;:true,&quot;textBadge&quot;:null,&quot;seal&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6a55f876172a7c9e12eea5d2&quot;,&quot;brand&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Kinisium&quot;},&quot;offers&quot;:[{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/Wireless-Security-Motion-SMS-Alerts/dp/B0CQPPFHWF/&quot;,&quot;price&quot;:&quot;$75&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;purchaseUri&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;sellerName&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;countryCode&quot;:&quot;US&quot;,&quot;offerId&quot;:&quot;6a55f8a88c2ec9babcb2f697&quot;,&quot;reducedPrice&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.co.uk/Instant-Alert-Wi-Fi-Motion-Sensor/dp/B0CQPP1PCY&quot;,&quot;price&quot;:&quot;£92&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;GBP&quot;,&quot;purchaseUri&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;sellerName&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;countryCode&quot;:&quot;GB&quot;,&quot;offerId&quot;:&quot;6a55f8a88c2ec9babcb2f698&quot;,&quot;reducedPrice&quot;:&quot;&quot;}],&quot;component&quot;:&quot;enhanced_product_card&quot;,&quot;total_index&quot;:3,&quot;hasMultipleImage&quot;:true,&quot;showProsConsData&quot;:false,&quot;videoIds&quot;:[],&quot;offersLength&quot;:2,&quot;hasBookmarkingFeature&quot;:true,&quot;isBookmarked&quot;:false,&quot;isBookmarkStatusReady&quot;:false}\" data-testid=\"feature-large-callout\"><p>Kinisium</p><p><h3 id=\"upc_6a55f876172a7c9e12eea5d2\" type=\"embed\">Kini SafeAlert Wi-Fi Motion Sensor</h3></p></div><p>This gadget is ideal if you have a specific cupboard, cabinet, or drawer you want to protect; maybe somewhere you keep valuables or medication, or perhaps a gun safe. It has sensors inside to detect movement in any direction, and you can simply place it, attach it with the steel cable tether, or stick it somewhere with adhesive. It only <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/how-to-set-up-smart-home-on-wi-fi-band/\">connects to 2.4-GHz Wi-Fi</a>, but it is highly configurable. You can set the sensitivity, cool-down period between alerts, axis monitoring (x, y, and z), and have it send alerts via the app, email, or text message. It is configurable via your web browser if you don’t want to use the mobile app.</p></div><div data-journey-hook=\"grid-wrapper\" data-testid=\"BodyWrapper\"><p>Kini is very reliable. I tested it in a drawer and a cabinet, and it always alerted me when they were opened. It also keeps a log with times listed. While alerts go via the cloud, maker Kinisium says it doesn’t collect data, and you can turn off logging entirely if you prefer. Kini also has a Stasis mode, so you can reverse it and have it alert you when there has been no movement for a set period. This makes it a versatile monitoring device, and you could use this mode to ensure an elderly relative opens their medicine cabinet each day or check what time your dog walker opened a door. Kini is also compatible with <a data-offer-url=\"https://ifttt.com/\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://ifttt.com/&quot;}\" href=\"https://ifttt.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">IFTTT</a> for automation, and there’s even a webhook integration that can send notifications to a custom URL.</p><p>There are loads of other motion sensors that can alert you to motion or presence in an area or room and <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/smart-home-security-tips/\">trigger lighting</a>, but the right one for you depends on your current <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/how-to-choose-your-smart-home-ecosystem/\">smart-home setup</a>.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/eve-motion-sensor-rave/\">I really like the Eve Motion Sensor</a>, but if you want it to trigger alerts, you need a smart-home hub, and you must set up an automation. It’s a reliable sensor that works indoors or out. I tested it with a Google Home system.</p><p>The <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.amazon.com/Aqara-Positioning-Multi-Person-Detection-Assistant/dp/B0BXWZMQJ3\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\" data-aps-asin=\"B0BXWZMQJ3\" data-aps-asc-tag=\"w050b-20\">Aqara FP2 Presence Sensor ($83)</a> has many features, including zonal and multiple person detection, and is compatible with all the major smart-home ecosystems, though it’s not always very accurate at identifying the number of people in the room. The more affordable <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.amazon.com/Aqara-Presence-Temperature-Detection-Assistant/dp/B0FG2MD3YP/\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\" data-aps-asin=\"B0FG2MD3YP\" data-aps-asc-tag=\"w050b-20\">Aqara FP300 ($50)</a> is a good enough presence detector for most folks and can also track light, temperature, and humidity.</p><p>The <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.amazon.com/SwitchBot-Bluetooth-Detection-Positioning-Compatible/dp/B0FSRJT4KW/\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\" data-aps-asin=\"B0FSRJT4KW\" data-aps-asc-tag=\"w050b-20\">Switchbot Presence Sensor ($30)</a> is the most affordable sensor I tested and has a similar feature set, but you will need a Switchbot hub if you want alerts, and there’s a lag between it detecting and alerting.</p><div id=\"6a55f93bc8e0799a2981817c\" type=\"embed\" data-item=\"{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;Philips Hue&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;Outdoor Motion Sensor&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:&quot;feature-medium&quot;,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/Phllips-Hue-570985-Philips-Outdoor/dp/B09KNP7ZTQ/&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;6a55f93bc8e0799a2981817c&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:&quot;Photograph: Simon Hill&quot;,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:true,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;isUpcEnabled&quot;:true,&quot;showClampedProductDescription&quot;:true,&quot;productDescriptionLineLength&quot;:5,&quot;hasReadMoreFeature&quot;:false,&quot;index&quot;:3,&quot;hasAffiliateLinkDisabled&quot;:false,&quot;isMobileView&quot;:false,&quot;showMultipleImageCount&quot;:4,&quot;hasProsConsFeature&quot;:false,&quot;hasRatingFeature&quot;:false,&quot;pros&quot;:[],&quot;cons&quot;:[],&quot;rating&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shouldUseAmazonPrimeDayLiveAPIData&quot;:true,&quot;contentInfo&quot;:{&quot;contentUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.wired.com/story/best-motion-sensors-private-alternatives-security/&quot;,&quot;contentName&quot;:&quot;The Best Motion Sensors and Privacy Alternatives to Security Cameras&quot;},&quot;enableGtmFixesIntersectionObserver&quot;:true,&quot;enableGtmFixesUseRef&quot;:true,&quot;textBadge&quot;:null,&quot;seal&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;6a55f93bc8e0799a2981817c&quot;,&quot;brand&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Philips Hue&quot;},&quot;offers&quot;:[{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/Phllips-Hue-570985-Philips-Outdoor/dp/B09KNP7ZTQ/&quot;,&quot;price&quot;:&quot;$55&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;purchaseUri&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;sellerName&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;countryCode&quot;:&quot;US&quot;,&quot;offerId&quot;:&quot;6a55f9688c2ec9babcb2f6a2&quot;,&quot;reducedPrice&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.co.uk/Philips-Hue-Outdoor-Lighting-Accessory/dp/B09CV7MT5S/&quot;,&quot;price&quot;:&quot;£55&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;GBP&quot;,&quot;purchaseUri&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;reducedPrice&quot;:&quot;£51&quot;,&quot;sellerName&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;countryCode&quot;:&quot;GB&quot;,&quot;offerId&quot;:&quot;6a55f9688c2ec9babcb2f6a3&quot;}],&quot;component&quot;:&quot;enhanced_product_card&quot;,&quot;total_index&quot;:2,&quot;hasMultipleImage&quot;:true,&quot;showProsConsData&quot;:false,&quot;videoIds&quot;:[],&quot;offersLength&quot;:2,&quot;hasBookmarkingFeature&quot;:true,&quot;isBookmarked&quot;:false,&quot;isBookmarkStatusReady&quot;:false}\" data-testid=\"GenericCallout\"><p>Philips Hue</p><p><h3 id=\"upc_6a55f93bc8e0799a2981817c\" type=\"embed\">Outdoor Motion Sensor</h3></p></div><p>The Philips Hue Outdoor Motion Sensor is excellent, but only if you already have a Hue setup, because it needs a Hue Bridge to connect to. I installed the sensor in my backyard and tested it with the Bridge Pro. It reliably detects people with few false positives. I configured my outdoor sensor to turn on a backyard light strip (not Hue) after sunset and send me a notification when triggered between specific hours (midnight and 6 am) using Google Gemini.</p><p>There’s also a Philips Hue Indoor Motion Sensor and a <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.amazon.com/Philips-Hue-Secure-Contact-Sensor/dp/B0CLBDVTJP/\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\" data-aps-asin=\"B0CLBDVTJP\" data-aps-asc-tag=\"w050b-20\">Contact Sensor ($40)</a> for doors and windows. Both are very reliable and can be configured to trigger alerts.</p><h2>Smart Light Sensing</h2><p>As an interesting alternative to dedicated motion sensors, you can also use some smart lights for detect presence and motion indoors.</p><p>Wiz SpaceSense</p><p>If you have a few Wiz lights, you can try <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.wizconnected.com/en-us/explore-wiz/spacesense\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\">SpaceSense</a>, which uses Wi-Fi to detect motion in rooms. I wasn’t that impressed when <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/wiz-spacesense-smart-lights/\">I tried SpaceSense</a>, but how effectively it works depends on how many Wiz lights you have and where they are located. I was also testing it as a way to automatically turn lights on, and there’s some lag that limits its usefulness on that score. But as a security alert that can tell you when there’s motion in your home when you’re away, it could be very useful. If you already have Wiz lights, you may as well try it, as it doesn’t require a subscription.</p><p>Philips Hue MotionAware</p><p>Signify is the parent company of Wiz and Philips Hue, and <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.philips-hue.com/en-us/support/article/motionawaretm--transform-your-hue-lights-into-motion-sensors/000011\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\">MotionAware</a> is very similar to SpaceSense, but it uses Zigbee, rather than Wi-Fi. Again, how well it works depends on the number of Philips Hue lights you have and their layout. Unfortunately, it does require a subscription if you want to receive alerts. MotionAware can trigger lights at no extra cost, but if you want motion alerts, you must pay $1 per month or $10 for the year. It is also included in Hue Secure subscriptions from $4 per month.</p><h2>More Security System Alternatives</h2><div id=\"669137d44b58f07dd716f8b6\" data-item=\"{&quot;ctaHref&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;dangerousDek&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;productBrand&quot;:&quot;SimpliSafe&quot;,&quot;dangerousHed&quot;:&quot;8-Piece Wireless Home Security System&quot;,&quot;embedSize&quot;:&quot;feature-medium&quot;,&quot;isFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;isSponsored&quot;:false,&quot;offerRetailer&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/SimpliSafe-Wireless-Security-System-Setup/dp/B07C38HT49&quot;,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;product&quot;,&quot;productId&quot;:&quot;669137d44b58f07dd716f8b6&quot;,&quot;showOfferUrl&quot;:false,&quot;showPriceOnButton&quot;:true,&quot;showAffiliateDisclaimerOnFirstProduct&quot;:false,&quot;dangerousCredit&quot;:&quot;Courtesy of SimpliSafe&quot;,&quot;showLocalisedOffers&quot;:true,&quot;hasCheckPriceFeature&quot;:false,&quot;isUpcEnabled&quot;:true,&quot;showClampedProductDescription&quot;:true,&quot;productDescriptionLineLength&quot;:5,&quot;hasReadMoreFeature&quot;:false,&quot;index&quot;:4,&quot;hasAffiliateLinkDisabled&quot;:false,&quot;isMobileView&quot;:false,&quot;showMultipleImageCount&quot;:4,&quot;hasProsConsFeature&quot;:false,&quot;hasRatingFeature&quot;:false,&quot;pros&quot;:[],&quot;cons&quot;:[],&quot;rating&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;shouldUseAmazonPrimeDayLiveAPIData&quot;:true,&quot;contentInfo&quot;:{&quot;contentUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.wired.com/story/best-motion-sensors-private-alternatives-security/&quot;,&quot;contentName&quot;:&quot;The Best Motion Sensors and Privacy Alternatives to Security Cameras&quot;},&quot;enableGtmFixesIntersectionObserver&quot;:true,&quot;enableGtmFixesUseRef&quot;:true,&quot;textBadge&quot;:null,&quot;seal&quot;:null,&quot;id&quot;:&quot;669137d44b58f07dd716f8b6&quot;,&quot;brand&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;SimpliSafe&quot;},&quot;offers&quot;:[{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.amazon.com/SimpliSafe-Wireless-Security-System-Setup/dp/B07C38HT49&quot;,&quot;price&quot;:&quot;$240&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;purchaseUri&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;reducedPrice&quot;:&quot;$229&quot;,&quot;sellerName&quot;:&quot;Amazon&quot;,&quot;countryCode&quot;:&quot;US&quot;,&quot;offerId&quot;:&quot;669138809b90abf946058786&quot;},{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.bestbuy.com/product/simplisafe-8pc-outdoor-home-security-system-white/J362VFSGHT/sku/6623892?&quot;,&quot;price&quot;:&quot;$350&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;purchaseUri&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;sellerName&quot;:&quot;Best Buy (Outdoor)&quot;,&quot;countryCode&quot;:&quot;US&quot;,&quot;offerId&quot;:&quot;6a04c36dad23bef5a2c2266b&quot;,&quot;reducedPrice&quot;:&quot;&quot;},{&quot;offerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://www.bestbuy.com/product/simplisafe-7pc-indoor-security-system-white/J362VFSGH7/sku/6622863?&quot;,&quot;price&quot;:&quot;$230&quot;,&quot;currency&quot;:&quot;USD&quot;,&quot;purchaseUri&quot;:&quot;https://cna.&quot;,&quot;sellerName&quot;:&quot;Best Buy (Indoor)&quot;,&quot;countryCode&quot;:&quot;US&quot;,&quot;offerId&quot;:&quot;6a04c3a75e9d85ebe7dc6367&quot;,&quot;reducedPrice&quot;:&quot;&quot;}],&quot;component&quot;:&quot;unified_product_card&quot;,&quot;total_index&quot;:1,&quot;hasMultipleImage&quot;:false,&quot;showProsConsData&quot;:false,&quot;videoIds&quot;:[],&quot;offersLength&quot;:3,&quot;hasBookmarkingFeature&quot;:true,&quot;isBookmarked&quot;:false,&quot;isBookmarkStatusReady&quot;:false}\" data-testid=\"feature-large-callout\"><div><p><a href=\"https://cna.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener sponsored\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-offer-url=\"https://www.amazon.com/SimpliSafe-Wireless-Security-System-Setup/dp/B07C38HT49\" data-aps-asin=\"B07C38HT49\" data-aps-asc-tag=\"w050b-20\"><span><picture><img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Image may contain: Electronics, Phone, Mobile Phone, Electrical Device, and Switch\" srcset=\"https://media.wired.com/photos/6a5a7186ef566878c27c2721/4:3/w_120,c_limit/SimpliSafe-8-Piece-Wireless-Home-Security-System.jpg 120w, https://media.wired.com/photos/6a5a7186ef566878c27c2721/4:3/w_240,c_limit/SimpliSafe-8-Piece-Wireless-Home-Security-System.jpg 240w, https://media.wired.com/photos/6a5a7186ef566878c27c2721/4:3/w_320,c_limit/SimpliSafe-8-Piece-Wireless-Home-Security-System.jpg 320w, https://media.wired.com/photos/6a5a7186ef566878c27c2721/4:3/w_640,c_limit/SimpliSafe-8-Piece-Wireless-Home-Security-System.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"https://media.wired.com/photos/6a5a7186ef566878c27c2721/4:3/w_640%2Cc_limit/SimpliSafe-8-Piece-Wireless-Home-Security-System.jpg\"></picture></span></a></p></div><div><p>SimpliSafe</p><p><h3 id=\"upc_669137d44b58f07dd716f8b6\" type=\"embed\">8-Piece Wireless Home Security System</h3></p></div></div><p>You might consider a modular security system. <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/simplisafe-rave-2026/\">We like the Simplisafe system</a>, which offers a base station, keypad, and a range of sensors. You can also find modular systems from security stalwarts like <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.adt.com/blu/shop/build-my-system\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\">ADT</a> and <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.vivint.com/display/other/security\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\">Vivint</a>, and security camera makers like <a data-offer-url=\"https://www.eufy.com/collections/alarm-system\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\">Eufy</a> and <a data-offer-url=\"https://us.arlo.com/collections/home-security-system/products/arlo-security-system\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\">Arlo</a>.</p></div><div data-journey-hook=\"grid-wrapper\" data-testid=\"BodyWrapper\"><p>And lastly, if you’re interested in <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/gallery/best-age-tech/\">age tech</a> to remotely monitor an elderly relative without intruding with a camera, I'd recommend checking out <a data-offer-url=\"https://nomosmartcare.com/\" data-event-click=\"{&quot;element&quot;:&quot;ExternalLink&quot;,&quot;outgoingURL&quot;:&quot;https://cna.st/affiliate-&quot;}\" href=\"https://cna.st/affiliate-\" rel=\"sponsored\" target=\"_blank\">Nomo Smart Care</a>. It offers motion sensors capable of fall detection and a wearable panic button.</p></div></div></div>",
